    "description": "### Impact\nPrevent stored HTML injection by URL-encoding free-form `action_code_who` values before interpolating them into trusted mention-link `href` attributes in the topic small-action and nested-activity-log components. Quote-bearing display names such as `\"><img src=x>` are now kept inside a single encoded URL path component and rendered as plain text, preventing attribute termination and injected elements.\n\n### Patches\nUpgrade to the patched version.\n\n### Workarounds\nUpgrade to the patched version.",
